==Description==
Figureheads are a [[:Category:Decoration|decorative]] [[Ship Components|ship component]]. They are craftable from a [[Assembly Station]]. Some of the figureheads available are exclusive to the [[Founder's Pack|Founder]] or Pioneer packs.

=Figureheads=
